  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 149,
    "summary": "Praise the Lord in the congregation of the Saints—He will beautify the meek with salvation.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Praise ye the Lord. Sing unto the Lord a new song, and his praise in the congregation of saints.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 89,
            "end": 95,
            "text": "TG Saints."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 54
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let Israel rejoice in him that made him: let the children of Zion be joyful in their King.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "Ps. 95:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 65,
            "text": "Joel 2:23; D&C 84:56."
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 89,
            "text": "Alma 5:50."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them praise his name in the dance: let them sing praises unto him with the timbrel and harp.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord taketh pleasure in his people: he will beautify the meek with salvation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "TG Beauty."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let the saints be joyful in glory: let them sing aloud upon their beds.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "TG Glory."
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "TG Singing."
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "Ps. 63:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let the high praises of God be in their mouth, and a twoedged sword in their hand;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "D&C 6:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3
          },
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 20
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "To execute vengeance upon the heathen, and punishments upon the people;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 42
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "To bind their kings with chains, and their nobles with fetters of iron;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "To execute upon them the judgment written: this honour have all his saints. Praise ye the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
